<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>


    <%- include('../layouts/head',{title:'FansFund | codewithsadee'})%>
</head>
<body class="background on-surface-text">

    <!--
    - #TOP BAR
    -->
    
    <header class="top-bar">
        <div class="container">

        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <img src="/images/banner.png" alt="FansFund"/>   
        </a>

    </div>
    </header>


<main>
        <article>

<!--
   -HERO         
-->
   
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">

        <figure class="hero-banner">
            <img src="/images/banner.png" width="944" height="280" alt="" class="img-cover">
        </figure>

        <div class="hero-card">

        <figure class="card-banner">
            <img src="/images/profile-photo.png" width="120" height="120" alt="" class="img-cover">
        </figure>    

        <div class="card-container">

            <h2 class="title-large">falak</h2>

        <p class="subtitle body-medium on-surface-variant-text">
            Software Engineer
        </p>

        <p class="subtitle body-medium on-surface-text">
            This is a simple Buy Me a Coffee style platform where people can support me with small donations.
        </p>

        <p class="subtitle body-medium on-surface-text">
            Your support helps me continue creating tutorials, projects and learning content.
        </p>        

        <p class="card-text body-medium on-surface-variant-text">
            Become proficient web developer through a hands-on project -centered
            approach.
        </p>

        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
   </section>


   <div class="container lg-col-2" >

   <!--
   - #CONTRIBUTE
   -->

   <section class="card elevated contribute">

    <h2 class="title-medium">
        show your love to fansfund
    </h2>

    <form action="" class="contribute-form" data-contribute-form>

        <div class="counter-wrapped">

            <div class="body-medium on-surface-variant-text counter-label">
                <span class="material-symbols-rounded primary-text icon-small">favorite</span>
            
            $1 each
            </div>

            <div class="counter">

           <button type="button" class="icon-btn filled" data-decrement-btn>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">remove</span>

            <div class="state-layer"></div>
           </button>

           <div class="text-field-wrapper counter-field">
            <input type="number" name="amount"  value="1" min="1" max="999" required class="text-field outlined body-large" data-counter-field data-form-field>
           </div>

           <button type="button" class="icon-btn filled" data-increment-btn>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">add</span>

            <div class="state-layer"></div>
           </button>

        </div>

        </div>

        <div class="text-field-wrapper">
            <label for="name" class="text-field-label body-large">Name</label>

            <input type="text" name="name" id="name" placeholder="Name or @yourtwitter(optional)" class="text-field outlined body-large" data-form-field>
        </div>
    
        <div class="text-field-wrapper">
            <label for="email" class="text-field-label body-large">Email</label>

            <input type="email" name="email" id="email" placeholder="your email address" required class="text-field outlined body-large" data-form-field>
        </div>
    
     <div class="text-field-wrapper">
            <label for="message" class="text-field-label body-large">Message</label>

            <textarea name="message"  id="message" placeholder="Say something (optional)" class="text-field outlined body-large" data-form-field></textarea>
     </div>
    
    <button type="submit" class="button filled label-large" data-submit-btn>
        contribute $<span data-total>1</span>

        <div class="state-layer"></div>
    </button>


    </form>
   
 </section>
 <div>

<!--
- #ABOUT    
-->

<section class="card outlined about">

    <h2 class="title-medium">About</h2>

    <p class="card-text on-surface-variant-text body-medium">
        hey there! If you have learned anything from my work or just enjoy our time 
        together on youtube, you can now show your support - thank you so much !
    </p>
    <p class="on-surface-variant-text body-medium wrapper">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded icon-small">alternate_email</span>

        <a href="mailto:codewithsadee@gmail.com">codewithsadee@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <ul class="social-list">

        <li>
            <a href="https://youtube.com/codewithsadee" target="_blank" class="social-link">
                <img src="/images/youtube.svg" width="24" height="24" alt="youtube">
            </a>
        </li>

         <li>
            <a href="https://instagram.com/codewithsadee" target="_blank" class="social-link">
                <img src="/images/instagram.svg" width="24" height="24" alt="instagram">
            </a>
        </li>

         <li>
            <a href="https://twitter.com/codewithsadee" target="_blank" class="social-link">
                <img src="/images/x.svg" width="24" height="24" alt="x">
            </a>
        </li>

         <li>
            <a href="https://discord.gg/DhhydBpPFp" class="social-link">
                <img src="/images/discord.svg" width="24" height="24" alt="discord">
            </a>
        </li>

    </ul>
</section>


<!--
- #HISTORY
-->

<section class="card outlined history">

    <h2 class="title-medium">Recent supporters</h2>

    <ul class="history-list">

        <li class="history-card">

            <div class="card-header">
                <div class="card-avatar label-large">JD</div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="title-small card-title">
                John Doe contribute with <span class="primary-text">$10</span>
            </h3>

            <p class="card-body body-large on-surface-variant-text">
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Quis magni pariatur vel, officiis architecto molestiae minima doloremque reprehenderit sed, blanditiis eum optio rem perspiciatis quaerat ad accusamus illo porro suscipit.
            </p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>

</div>


   </div>
        </article>
    </main>


    <!--
    - #FOOTER
    -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <p class="body-medium on-surface-variant-text">
            &copy; 2024 codewithsadee
        </p>
    </footer>
 

 
</body>
</html>
